# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is git-ignored; this file is not.
#
# Optional. Public dataset imports (`apps/control-plane`'s HF import, issue
# #45) work with no token at all -- but an anonymous request shares a low,
# IP-based rate limit, where an authenticated one goes against the token
# owner's own, much higher quota. Get a free read token from
# https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
HF_TOKEN=
